#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:1
msgid "S3 API"
msgstr "S3 API"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:3
msgid ""
"S3-compatible object storage helpers are available under `ptool.s3` and "
"`p.s3`."
msgstr "S3 兼容对象存储辅助能力位于 `ptool.s3` 和 `p.s3` 下。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:5
msgid "ptool.s3.connect"
msgstr "ptool.s3.connect"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:7
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:7"
msgid "`v0.10.0` - Introduced."
msgstr "`v0.10.0` - 引入。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:9
msgid ""
"`ptool.s3.connect(options)` opens an S3-compatible object storage connection "
"and returns a `Connection` object."
msgstr "`ptool.s3.connect(options)` 打开一个 S3 兼容对象存储连接，并返回一个 "
"`Connection` 对象。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:12
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:12"
msgid "`options` fields:"
msgstr "`options` 字段："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:14
msgid "`bucket` (string, required): The bucket name."
msgstr "`bucket`（string，必填）：bucket 名称。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:15
msgid "`region` (string, optional): The AWS region or provider region."
msgstr "`region`（string，选填）：AWS 区域或服务提供商区域。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:16
msgid ""
"`endpoint` (string, optional): A custom S3-compatible endpoint URL such as "
"MinIO, R2, or another object storage service."
msgstr "`endpoint`（string，选填）：自定义的 S3 兼容 endpoint URL，例如 MinIO、R2 或"
"其他对象存储服务。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:18
msgid "`access_key_id` (string, optional): The access key ID."
msgstr "`access_key_id`（string，选填）：访问密钥 ID。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:19
msgid "`secret_access_key` (string, optional): The secret access key."
msgstr "`secret_access_key`（string，选填）：访问密钥 secret。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:20
msgid "`session_token` (string, optional): The session token."
msgstr "`session_token`（string，选填）：会话令牌。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:21
msgid ""
"`root` (string, optional): A root prefix applied to all object operations."
msgstr "`root`（string，选填）：应用到所有对象操作的根前缀。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:22
msgid ""
"`allow_anonymous` (boolean, optional): When `true`, allow unsigned requests "
"if credentials are not configured. Defaults to `false`."
msgstr "`allow_anonymous`（boolean，选填）：当为 `true` 时，如果未配置凭证，则允许未"
"签名请求。默认为 `false`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:25
msgid "Environment fallback:"
msgstr "环境变量回退："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:27
msgid "Explicit `options` values win."
msgstr "显式传入的 `options` 值优先。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:28
msgid ""
"Missing `region`, `endpoint`, `access_key_id`, `secret_access_key`, and "
"`session_token` values fall back to:"
msgstr ""
"缺失的 `region`、`endpoint`、`access_key_id`、`secret_access_key` 和 "
"`session_token` 会回退到："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:28
msgid "`AWS_REGION`"
msgstr "`AWS_REGION`"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:28
msgid "`AWS_ENDPOINT`, `AWS_ENDPOINT_URL`, or `AWS_S3_ENDPOINT`"
msgstr "`AWS_ENDPOINT`、`AWS_ENDPOINT_URL` 或 `AWS_S3_ENDPOINT`"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:28
msgid "`AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`"
msgstr "`AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:28
msgid "`AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`"
msgstr "`AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:28
msgid "`AWS_SESSION_TOKEN`"
msgstr "`AWS_SESSION_TOKEN`"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:35
msgid ""
"Environment fallback uses `ptool`'s runtime environment view, so values set "
"through `p.os.setenv(...)` are also visible to `ptool.s3.connect(...)`."
msgstr ""
"环境变量回退使用 `ptool` 的运行时环境视图，因此通过 `p.os.setenv(...)` 设置的"
"值也会被 `ptool.s3.connect(...)` 看到。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:38
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:38"
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:51
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Connection"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:53
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:53"
msgid "`v0.10.0` - Introduced."
msgstr "`v0.10.0` - 引入。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:55
msgid ""
"`Connection` represents an open object storage connection returned by "
"`ptool.s3.connect()`."
msgstr "`Connection` 表示由 `ptool.s3.connect()` 返回的已打开对象存储连接。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:58
msgid "It is implemented as a Lua userdata."
msgstr "它实现为 Lua userdata。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:60
msgid "Methods:"
msgstr "方法："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:62
msgid "`conn:read(path[, options])` -> `string`"
msgstr "`conn:read(path[, options])` -> `string`"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:63
msgid "`conn:write(path, content[, options])` -> `table`"
msgstr "`conn:write(path, content[, options])` -> `table`"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:64
msgid "`conn:delete(path)` -> `nil`"
msgstr "`conn:delete(path)` -> `nil`"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:65
msgid "`conn:exists(path)` -> `boolean`"
msgstr "`conn:exists(path)` -> `boolean`"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:66
msgid "`conn:list([prefix])` -> `table`"
msgstr "`conn:list([prefix])` -> `table`"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:67
msgid "`conn:stat(path)` -> `table`"
msgstr "`conn:stat(path)` -> `table`"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:68
msgid "`conn:put_bucket_acl(options)` -> `nil`"
msgstr "`conn:put_bucket_acl(options)` -> `nil`"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:69
msgid "`conn:put_object_acl(path, options)` -> `nil`"
msgstr "`conn:put_object_acl(path, options)` -> `nil`"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:71
msgid "Path rules:"
msgstr "路径规则："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:73
msgid "Object paths must be non-empty strings unless otherwise noted."
msgstr "除非另有说明，对象路径必须是非空字符串。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:74
msgid ""
"Leading `/` is ignored, so `/foo/bar.txt` and `foo/bar.txt` target the same "
"object."
msgstr "前导 `/` 会被忽略，因此 `/foo/bar.txt` 和 `foo/bar.txt` 指向同一个对象。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:76
msgid ""
"Paths are relative to `root` when `root` is configured on the connection."
msgstr "当连接配置了 `root` 时，路径会相对于 `root` 解析。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:78
msgid "Entry table shape:"
msgstr "条目 table 结构："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:80
msgid "`path` (string): The object path relative to the connection root."
msgstr "`path`（string）：相对于连接根路径的对象路径。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:81
msgid "`size` (integer): The object size in bytes."
msgstr "`size`（integer）：对象大小，单位为字节。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:82
msgid "`etag` (string | nil): The object ETag when available."
msgstr "`etag`（string | nil）：对象的 ETag（如果可用）。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:83
msgid ""
"`last_modified` (string | nil): The last-modified timestamp when available."
msgstr "`last_modified`（string | nil）：最后修改时间戳（如果可用）。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:84
msgid "`content_type` (string | nil): The object content type when available."
msgstr "`content_type`（string | nil）：对象内容类型（如果可用）。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:85
msgid "`version` (string | nil): The object version when available."
msgstr "`version`（string | nil）：对象版本（如果可用）。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:86
msgid "`metadata` (table | nil): User-defined object metadata when available."
msgstr "`metadata`（table | nil）：用户定义的对象元信息（如果可用）。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:87
msgid "`is_file` (boolean): Whether the entry is a file."
msgstr "`is_file`（boolean）：该条目是否为文件。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:88
msgid "`is_dir` (boolean): Whether the entry is a directory."
msgstr "`is_dir`（boolean）：该条目是否为目录。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:89
msgid "`mode` (string): One of `\"file\"`, `\"dir\"`, or `\"unknown\"`."
msgstr "`mode`（string）：`\"file\"`、`\"dir\"` 或 `\"unknown\"` 之一。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:91
msgid "read"
msgstr "read"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:93
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:93"
msgid "`v0.10.0` - Introduced. Unreleased - Changed."
msgstr "`v0.10.0` - 引入。Unreleased - Changed。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:96
msgid "Canonical API name: `ptool.s3.Connection:read`."
msgstr "规范 API 名称：`ptool.s3.Connection:read`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:98
msgid ""
"`conn:read(path[, options])` reads an object as raw bytes and returns a Lua "
"string."
msgstr "`conn:read(path[, options])` 以原始字节读取对象，并返回 Lua 字符串。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:100
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:100"
msgid "`path` (string, required): The object path."
msgstr "`path`（string，必填）：对象路径。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:101
msgid "`options` (table, optional): Read options."
msgstr "`options`（table，选填）：读取选项。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:102
msgid "Returns: `string`."
msgstr "返回：`string`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:104
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:104"
msgid "`options` fields:"
msgstr "`options` 字段："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:106
msgid ""
"`range` (table, optional): Reads a byte range using half-open bounds `["
"start, end)`."
msgstr "`range`（table，选填）：使用半开区间 `[start, end)` 读取字节范围。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:106
msgid "`start` (integer, optional): The first byte offset to include."
msgstr "`start`（integer，选填）：要包含的首个字节偏移。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:106
msgid "`end` (integer, optional): The first byte offset to exclude."
msgstr "`end`（integer，选填）：要排除的首个字节偏移。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:111
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:111"
msgid "Behavior:"
msgstr "行为："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:113
msgid "Omitting `range` reads the full object."
msgstr "省略 `range` 时读取整个对象。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:114
msgid "`{ start = N }` reads from byte `N` to the end."
msgstr "`{ start = N }` 从字节 `N` 读取到结尾。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:115
msgid ""
"`{ end = N }` reads from the beginning up to, but not including, byte `N`."
msgstr "`{ end = N }` 从开头读取到字节 `N` 之前，但不包含字节 `N`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:116
msgid "`{ start = A, end = B }` reads bytes `A` through `B - 1`."
msgstr "`{ start = A, end = B }` 读取从字节 `A` 到 `B - 1` 的内容。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:118
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:118"
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:131
msgid "write"
msgstr "write"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:133
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:133"
msgid "`v0.10.0` - Introduced. Unreleased - Changed."
msgstr "`v0.10.0` - 引入。Unreleased - Changed。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:136
msgid "Canonical API name: `ptool.s3.Connection:write`."
msgstr "规范 API 名称：`ptool.s3.Connection:write`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:138
msgid ""
"`conn:write(path, content[, options])` writes a Lua string to an object as "
"raw bytes and returns an entry table."
msgstr "`conn:write(path, content[, options])` 将 Lua 字符串作为原始字节写入对象，并"
"返回条目表。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:141
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:141"
msgid "`path` (string, required): The object path."
msgstr "`path`（string，必填）：对象路径。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:142
msgid "`content` (string, required): The bytes to upload."
msgstr "`content`（string，必填）：要上传的字节内容。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:143
msgid "`options` (table, optional): Write options."
msgstr "`options`（table，选填）：写入选项。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:144
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:144"
msgid "Returns: `table`."
msgstr "返回：`table`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:146
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:146"
msgid "`options` fields:"
msgstr "`options` 字段："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:148
msgid "`content_type` (string, optional): Sets the object content type."
msgstr "`content_type`（string，选填）：设置对象内容类型。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:149
msgid ""
"`cache_control` (string, optional): Sets the object cache-control header."
msgstr "`cache_control`（string，选填）：设置对象 cache-control 头。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:150
msgid ""
"`content_disposition` (string, optional): Sets the object content-"
"disposition header."
msgstr "`content_disposition`（string，选填）：设置对象 content-disposition 头。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:152
msgid ""
"`content_encoding` (string, optional): Sets the object content-encoding "
"header."
msgstr "`content_encoding`（string，选填）：设置对象 content-encoding 头。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:154
msgid ""
"`metadata` (table, optional): Sets user-defined metadata as string key/value "
"pairs."
msgstr "`metadata`（table，选填）：将用户定义元信息设置为字符串键值对。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:156
msgid ""
"`if_not_exists` (boolean, optional): Write only when the object does not "
"already exist. Defaults to `false`."
msgstr "`if_not_exists`（boolean，选填）：仅当对象尚不存在时写入。默认为 `false`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:158
msgid ""
"`if_match` (string, optional): Write only when the current ETag matches."
msgstr "`if_match`（string，选填）：仅当当前 ETag 匹配时写入。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:159
msgid ""
"`if_none_match` (string, optional): Write only when the current ETag does "
"not match."
msgstr "`if_none_match`（string，选填）：仅当当前 ETag 不匹配时写入。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:162
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:162"
msgid "Behavior:"
msgstr "行为："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:164
msgid "`content` is uploaded byte-for-byte."
msgstr "`content` 会按字节原样上传。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:165
msgid "Embedded NUL bytes and non-UTF-8 bytes are preserved."
msgstr "嵌入的 NUL 字节和非 UTF-8 字节会被保留。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:166
msgid ""
"The returned entry avoids an immediate follow-up `stat()` call for common "
"metadata."
msgstr "返回的条目可避免为了常见元信息立刻再调用一次 `stat()`。"

